Maintainer: Anthony Green <green@moxielogic.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13), sbcl, libfixposix-dev, gcc, make

Package: happening
Architecture: amd64
Description: A privacy-focused, self-hosted web analytics platform
 Happening is a privacy-focused, self-hosted web analytics platform built
 in Common Lisp. It provides lightweight, cookie-free website analytics
 with a focus on data ownership and user privacy.
